WEBVTT

00:04:08.260 --> 00:04:11.560
Do you want me to devour you?

00:05:59.130 --> 00:06:02.000
They're... not hiding themselves well, are they?

00:06:02.000 --> 00:06:06.220
<b>Metro M</b>

00:06:03.130 --> 00:06:04.710
Shall we go check it out?

00:06:04.710 --> 00:06:06.220
Please wait.

00:06:06.760 --> 00:06:08.930
It what? Escaped?!

00:06:08.930 --> 00:06:09.840
What is it?

00:06:09.840 --> 00:06:12.600
He said that another unit captured it again.

00:06:12.600 --> 00:06:13.180
Where?

00:07:42.810 --> 00:07:43.770
Who...

00:07:46.270 --> 00:07:47.440
...are you?

00:08:29.110 --> 00:08:30.940
Destruction of target confirmed.

00:08:31.440 --> 00:08:32.990
There are two eyewitnesses.

00:08:32.990 --> 00:08:34.740
Recovery unit, you're up.

00:08:42.250 --> 00:08:43.080
Corpse!

00:08:43.080 --> 00:08:44.420
It's a corpse!

00:08:51.880 --> 00:08:52.840
Who...

00:08:53.720 --> 00:08:55.050
...are you?

00:08:57.050 --> 00:08:59.060
Fujimura-kun?

00:09:02.270 --> 00:09:03.520
Mana-chan?

00:09:04.640 --> 00:09:05.900
Hiiragi.

00:09:05.900 --> 00:09:07.100
You...!

00:09:11.280 --> 00:09:14.320
Is this an... Elder Bairn?

00:09:14.320 --> 00:09:15.530
Elder Bairn?

00:09:15.530 --> 00:09:17.360
What is this?

00:09:17.360 --> 00:09:18.950
Matsuo-kun?

00:09:18.950 --> 00:09:20.200
Fuji, let's get out of here!

00:09:20.200 --> 00:09:21.790
R-Right!

00:09:22.200 --> 00:09:23.330
Hiiragi.

00:09:35.550 --> 00:09:37.050
Not good. Hurry!

00:09:51.980 --> 00:09:53.610
Just drive.

00:09:53.610 --> 00:09:54.780
What are you?

00:09:54.780 --> 00:09:55.650
You...!

00:09:55.650 --> 00:09:56.860
They'll catch us.

00:09:58.660 --> 00:09:59.700
Shit!

00:10:13.880 --> 00:10:16.510
The eyewitnesses are on the run.

00:10:16.510 --> 00:10:18.630
Currently in pursuit.

00:10:18.630 --> 00:10:20.550
Ground units, move quickly.

00:10:27.600 --> 00:10:29.520
They're coming!

00:10:29.520 --> 00:10:31.690
I need you to point the way!

00:10:36.570 --> 00:10:37.700
Come in SIRRUT.

00:10:37.700 --> 00:10:38.950
This is Fujimura!

00:10:38.950 --> 00:10:41.240
We're being chased by a Tower helicopter!

00:10:41.450 --> 00:10:44.330
We need help, Yanagi-san!

00:10:44.660 --> 00:10:47.200
Calm down, Fujimura-kun

00:10:48.410 --> 00:10:50.250
R-Right.

00:10:50.250 --> 00:10:52.710
We'll send you an escape route in a moment.

00:10:53.540 --> 00:10:57.590
Till then, send us the information you have acquired.

00:10:57.590 --> 00:10:59.470
G-Got it.

00:10:59.470 --> 00:11:00.180
Tsuki-chan.

00:11:01.340 --> 00:11:03.760
Take over control of the traffic system.

00:11:03.760 --> 00:11:04.640
Okay.

00:11:04.970 --> 00:11:07.640
Also, hack into the Department of Land and Transportation's computer system.

00:11:08.600 --> 00:11:09.980
Okay...

00:11:11.980 --> 00:11:14.190
Are things good on your end, Mogari-san?

00:11:18.400 --> 00:11:19.360
Yes.

00:11:44.760 --> 00:11:45.550
There!

00:11:45.550 --> 00:11:46.180
Right.

00:11:46.180 --> 00:11:47.100
Right!

00:11:47.100 --> 00:11:49.140
Stupid! That's a one-way street!

00:11:49.640 --> 00:11:51.440
Sorry about that.

00:11:54.980 --> 00:11:56.570
We've received our escape route.

00:11:57.360 --> 00:12:00.070
Um... up ahead...

00:12:00.070 --> 00:12:02.530
Make a right at the traffic lights.

00:12:12.500 --> 00:12:14.460
Not this way!

00:12:13.170 --> 00:12:14.460
Be quiet!

00:12:21.300 --> 00:12:23.430
We went off the route...

00:12:24.090 --> 00:12:26.100
It couldn't be helped!

00:12:27.300 --> 00:12:28.390
I'll fix this.

00:12:28.390 --> 00:12:29.560
Fuji-kun.

00:12:32.060 --> 00:12:32.980
Behind us!

00:12:32.980 --> 00:12:34.310
They're coming!

00:12:35.770 --> 00:12:37.020
Is this it?

00:12:38.020 --> 00:12:39.440
Yanagi-san!

00:12:40.280 --> 00:12:41.400
Keep it up.

00:12:42.570 --> 00:12:44.110
You need to go faster.

00:12:44.110 --> 00:12:45.070
Step on it!

00:12:45.610 --> 00:12:47.830
It's all or nothing!

00:13:00.420 --> 00:13:01.340
Do it now.

00:13:01.340 --> 00:13:02.380
Right.

00:13:19.060 --> 00:13:21.030
And with this, it's over.

00:13:28.820 --> 00:13:29.950
We have to keep running.

00:13:47.510 --> 00:13:48.840
You're bleeding...

00:13:49.350 --> 00:13:50.470
Don't worry.

00:13:55.140 --> 00:13:56.730
That guy...

00:13:56.730 --> 00:13:58.690
...was dead.

00:14:02.570 --> 00:14:05.110
It's over now, right?

00:14:05.110 --> 00:14:07.910
Just look at all these scratches.

00:14:07.910 --> 00:14:09.870
My beautiful car...

00:14:09.870 --> 00:14:12.120
It's the ultimate sacrifice.

00:14:12.910 --> 00:14:14.700
I'm...

00:14:14.700 --> 00:14:17.250
...Hiiragi Mana.

00:14:17.250 --> 00:14:18.500
Who are you?

00:14:19.630 --> 00:14:21.840
You guys don't know each other?

00:14:23.170 --> 00:14:25.210
She rescued me...

00:14:26.220 --> 00:14:28.800
....from that scary thing.

00:14:29.680 --> 00:14:30.800
She did?

00:14:30.800 --> 00:14:33.060
From Tower's Elder Bairns?

00:14:35.140 --> 00:14:36.270
What?

00:14:36.270 --> 00:14:38.230
How do you know about the Elder Bairns?

00:14:38.520 --> 00:14:39.690
I'm... sorry...

00:14:39.690 --> 00:14:41.770
Hey! What are you doing?!

00:14:43.020 --> 00:14:45.030
What is "Tower"?

00:14:45.820 --> 00:14:47.070
Where is it?

00:14:47.360 --> 00:14:52.280
That's what we'd like to know...

00:15:00.790 --> 00:15:05.300
We're doing this to uncover the identity of Tower.

00:15:05.300 --> 00:15:07.380
How about you?

00:15:07.380 --> 00:15:09.470
Do you have a grudge against them?

00:15:11.220 --> 00:15:13.010
What happened back there?

00:15:13.600 --> 00:15:18.230
Why was that monster dead?

00:15:20.100 --> 00:15:21.400
Because...

00:15:21.770 --> 00:15:23.440
...I killed it.

00:15:26.900 --> 00:15:30.070
Just what are you?

00:15:36.910 --> 00:15:38.660
A message from Headquarters?

00:15:38.660 --> 00:15:39.580
Is it Yanagi-san?

00:15:42.170 --> 00:15:44.000
Kisaragi Saya...

00:15:45.290 --> 00:15:48.210
Would you like to strike Nanahara Fumito down?

00:15:49.050 --> 00:15:50.510
Fumito?

00:15:56.180 --> 00:15:58.020
Come talk with me.

00:15:58.560 --> 00:16:00.180
I'll wait...

00:16:00.180 --> 00:16:01.690
...until you get here.

00:16:13.360 --> 00:16:16.280
To the victor, the spoils...

00:16:17.280 --> 00:16:18.870
To the vanquished...

00:16:19.620 --> 00:16:21.120
...damnation.

00:16:36.050 --> 00:16:37.300
Fumito-sama.

00:16:38.850 --> 00:16:42.390
Regarding the issue of those who repeatedly ignore of the Juvenile Protection Curfew Act,

00:16:42.390 --> 00:16:44.730
which has been in action since last month...

00:16:44.730 --> 00:16:47.480
We have received a proposal from the governor of Tokyo.

00:16:48.480 --> 00:16:50.900
If only you'd hurry and become its governor instead.

00:16:51.280 --> 00:16:54.530
There would be no need for such wasteful meetings,

00:16:54.530 --> 00:16:55.700
Yuuka-kun.

00:16:56.370 --> 00:16:58.330
I agree with you.

00:16:59.910 --> 00:17:02.370
How old are you supposed to be now?

00:17:02.370 --> 00:17:04.000
I'm 28.

00:17:04.410 --> 00:17:07.630
And you were a high school student just six months ago.

00:17:08.630 --> 00:17:12.880
You want to forget those bad memories quickly, don't you?

00:17:14.050 --> 00:17:17.680
As long as you understand me, I'm fortunate.

00:17:17.680 --> 00:17:20.140
Next is a meeting with the American ambassador.

00:17:20.140 --> 00:17:23.390
He wishes to bring forward the meeting date.

00:17:23.890 --> 00:17:28.360
Recent appointments and reports are all like that...

00:17:28.360 --> 00:17:31.730
Considering the financial strength and influence of our company, Seventh Heaven,

00:17:31.730 --> 00:17:35.900
and the secrets that you and your brethren have been protecting,

00:17:37.070 --> 00:17:40.200
even this is not enough.

00:17:40.700 --> 00:17:42.540
You're a greedy one...

00:17:43.250 --> 00:17:45.160
Fumito-sama.

00:17:45.160 --> 00:17:47.170
What's up, Kutou?

00:17:48.330 --> 00:17:52.050
The one that escaped from the lab has been disposed of.

00:17:53.550 --> 00:17:56.260
We finished the recovery from inside the subway,

00:17:56.260 --> 00:17:59.890
but there were two witnesses.

00:18:00.220 --> 00:18:01.850
They were able to get away?

00:18:03.680 --> 00:18:06.350
I disposed of the ones who let them escape.

00:18:06.770 --> 00:18:10.270
Next time, I will handle it personally.

00:18:10.270 --> 00:18:13.070
It may be impossible... for you.

00:18:24.040 --> 00:18:25.790
Saya has come.

00:19:20.680 --> 00:19:22.300
We should get going.

00:19:46.030 --> 00:19:47.290
What's wrong?

00:19:48.700 --> 00:19:50.120
Get a move on.

00:19:58.380 --> 00:19:59.300
Come in.

00:20:05.220 --> 00:20:07.760
Hiiragi, I understand the situation.

00:20:07.760 --> 00:20:08.720
Y-Yes...

00:20:09.060 --> 00:20:11.980
Welcome, Kisaragi Saya.

00:20:11.980 --> 00:20:13.190
I am Mogari Kuroto.

00:20:13.560 --> 00:20:16.020
How do you know about me?

00:20:17.520 --> 00:20:19.030
Ukishima.

00:20:19.650 --> 00:20:21.650
A certain incident took place there,

00:20:21.950 --> 00:20:25.620
in which every inhabitant of that village was killed.

00:20:31.250 --> 00:20:32.870
In all honesty...

00:20:34.580 --> 00:20:37.920
...<i>horrifying</i> would best describe their demise.

00:20:49.390 --> 00:20:54.900
However, there was one lone survivor from that incident.

00:20:59.230 --> 00:21:02.030
That person was you, Kisaragi Saya.

00:21:06.410 --> 00:21:09.950
Why do you have these?

00:21:09.950 --> 00:21:12.120
Itsuki sent these to me.

00:21:13.710 --> 00:21:18.040
He was "Tomofusa Itsuki" to you, wasn't he?

00:21:18.040 --> 00:21:22.210
He hacked Tower's cameras and sent us data,

00:21:22.210 --> 00:21:24.130
even if it was only bits and pieces.

00:21:25.180 --> 00:21:27.300
Was that person...?

00:21:27.300 --> 00:21:30.680
He did not work with us,

00:21:30.970 --> 00:21:33.270
but he was a member of SIRRUT.

00:21:34.350 --> 00:21:35.730
How is Itsuki?

00:21:35.730 --> 00:21:37.150
He's dead.

00:21:39.110 --> 00:21:42.900
Itsuki participated in the Ukishima experiment.

00:21:42.900 --> 00:21:45.240
He wanted to expose everything about Tower.

00:21:45.240 --> 00:21:46.200
Tower?

00:21:47.160 --> 00:21:50.700
It's one of the organisations that Nakahara Fumito controls.

00:21:51.370 --> 00:21:56.500
Officially, Fumito has become the president of the company known as "Seventh Heaven"

00:21:57.120 --> 00:22:02.170
Not only in Japan, as he undoubtedly controls other corporate giants around the world, too.

00:22:02.880 --> 00:22:05.470
He has strong political connections,

00:22:05.470 --> 00:22:11.470
and there are rumours that he had a hand in the new Juvenile Protection Curfew Act.

00:22:11.470 --> 00:22:15.520
But the only thing he's interested in...

00:22:16.180 --> 00:22:18.650
...is his <i>other</i> organisation.

00:22:18.650 --> 00:22:21.230
And that'd be Tower, right?

00:22:21.230 --> 00:22:28.660
In order to achieve a certain goal, Fumito has used the power of both Seventh Heaven and Tower.

00:22:28.660 --> 00:22:29.700
A certain goal?

00:22:29.700 --> 00:22:31.490
"What would that be?"

00:22:31.490 --> 00:22:34.700
Unfortunately, we don't know what his plans are.

00:22:34.700 --> 00:22:39.750
But we're certain that many people have been killed in order to realise them.

00:22:39.750 --> 00:22:41.880
And that these...

00:22:43.000 --> 00:22:46.260
...<i>Elder Bairns</i> are somehow involved.

00:22:46.920 --> 00:22:49.680
How do you know all of this?

00:22:49.680 --> 00:22:51.260
Because of my investigations.

00:22:51.260 --> 00:22:55.560
By dedicating all of my time, money and power.

00:22:55.970 --> 00:22:56.730
Why?

00:22:57.480 --> 00:23:02.690
Because Nanahara Fumito took my freedom from me.

00:23:06.400 --> 00:23:07.650
And...

00:23:10.610 --> 00:23:14.450
The videos that Itsuki had sent were far from complete,

00:23:14.450 --> 00:23:19.330
which is why I haven't seen anything but tiny fragments of the time you spent in Ukishima.

00:23:19.330 --> 00:23:24.340
But I can tell you are a different person now,

00:23:24.340 --> 00:23:28.090
and that you were deceived by Fumito.

00:23:28.760 --> 00:23:33.260
You came to Tokyo to look for Fumito, didn't you?

00:23:33.930 --> 00:23:37.310
For the past six months, you've been appearing here and there.

00:23:37.720 --> 00:23:40.600
And you've been causing trouble each time.

00:23:41.060 --> 00:23:43.150
Although none of it has made it into the news.

00:23:43.610 --> 00:23:45.230
If it hasn't made it into the news...

00:23:45.230 --> 00:23:47.150
Investigations would've highlighted everything.

00:23:47.650 --> 00:23:52.570
The censorship of the Internet is currently very strict in Japan, especially in Tokyo.

00:23:52.570 --> 00:23:55.580
Yet we have two excellent hackers.

00:24:00.870 --> 00:24:05.090
This girl is one of them: Tsukiyama Hiro-san.

00:24:08.550 --> 00:24:11.130
And the other is...

00:24:11.840 --> 00:24:13.760
This one we're not so proud of.

00:24:13.760 --> 00:24:16.430
But this is Fujimura Shin-kun.

00:24:16.430 --> 00:24:20.480
And the big one here is Matsuo Iori-kun.

00:24:20.480 --> 00:24:21.020
Yo.

00:24:21.480 --> 00:24:24.100
Mana-san introduced herself in the car, didn't she?

00:24:28.190 --> 00:24:30.110
I am Yanagi Haruno.

00:24:30.110 --> 00:24:32.150
I'm Mogari-san's secretary.

00:24:32.150 --> 00:24:35.370
These are the members of SIRRUT who can currently access this mansion.

00:24:35.370 --> 00:24:36.160
That's all.

00:24:37.080 --> 00:24:43.830
There are many others who support us over the internet.

00:24:43.830 --> 00:24:47.630
Listen up! There is currently the Juvenile Protection Curfew Act, Internet censorship

00:24:47.630 --> 00:24:53.170
and other strange rules and regulations in effect. In order to abolish them, we are giving our best!

00:24:54.510 --> 00:24:57.100
Where is Fumito now?

00:24:57.640 --> 00:25:01.220
Currently Fumito is, for his protection...

00:25:01.220 --> 00:25:06.060
...keeping his whereabouts hidden from the public eye.

00:25:08.230 --> 00:25:09.770
Are you saying you don't know?

00:25:12.320 --> 00:25:14.400
I have ways to find him.

00:25:14.400 --> 00:25:19.530
The members of SIRRUT are connected through the network.

00:25:19.530 --> 00:25:23.540
They will provide you with Fumito’s information.

00:25:23.540 --> 00:25:27.880
Even so, I need your power, Kisaragi Saya.

00:25:39.970 --> 00:25:42.140
Nanahara Fumito is...

00:25:42.140 --> 00:25:43.730
...my prey.

00:25:49.690 --> 00:25:51.520
Do not forget that.

00:26:03.830 --> 00:26:07.080
Is it really okay to bring her into our group?

00:26:08.000 --> 00:26:09.170
Thank you.

00:26:11.290 --> 00:26:12.750
Here, Tsuki-chan.

00:26:12.750 --> 00:26:14.010
Thanks.

00:26:14.010 --> 00:26:15.510
What's this? Are you displeased?

00:26:16.170 --> 00:26:19.220
It's not that I'm displeased, it's her attitude.

00:26:19.220 --> 00:26:22.600
There's no way we can trust her.

00:26:22.600 --> 00:26:25.480
She hardly talks and she's <i>really</i> chauvinistic.

00:26:26.350 --> 00:26:29.310
But she's <i>really</i> pretty.

00:26:29.980 --> 00:26:32.820
Ah, so you don’t care as long as she's "pretty"?

00:26:32.820 --> 00:26:35.190
Did you forget about how she squeezed your cheeks?

00:26:35.190 --> 00:26:36.190
I give! I give!!

00:26:36.570 --> 00:26:38.820
It's Mogari-san's decision.

00:26:39.860 --> 00:26:42.280
I know that.

00:26:42.280 --> 00:26:46.660
But it upsets me, so I can't help but complain about it.

00:26:47.040 --> 00:26:49.710
Tsuki-chan feels the same, right?

00:26:50.670 --> 00:26:55.130
Tsuki-chan is upset because even 
though Mana-chan finally returned...

00:26:55.130 --> 00:26:59.180
...she has to show our new member around and can't play with her.

00:26:59.630 --> 00:27:03.850
Fuji-kun, I'm not gonna show you the cat video I downloaded yesterday...

00:27:05.270 --> 00:27:06.720
You'll show me, won’t you?!

00:27:06.720 --> 00:27:07.640
Don’t bother Fuji.

00:27:07.640 --> 00:27:10.690
You're being really mean!

00:27:18.820 --> 00:27:20.570
Isn't this an amazing mansion?

00:27:20.570 --> 00:27:24.620
Mogari-san is also the president of 
Sysnet, which is the number one company

00:27:24.620 --> 00:27:27.160
where recent graduates would like to work.

00:27:31.830 --> 00:27:32.960
Saya is...

00:27:33.790 --> 00:27:35.710
...a pretty name.

00:27:37.210 --> 00:27:41.380
Your last name, Kisaragi, is very nice too.

00:27:41.380 --> 00:27:44.470
That isn't my real name...

00:27:45.810 --> 00:27:46.930
But...

00:27:50.140 --> 00:27:53.190
Wait, your room is there.

00:27:56.820 --> 00:27:58.990
The bath is over there,

00:27:58.990 --> 00:28:00.450
and some clothes are...

00:28:00.450 --> 00:28:02.200
These are fine.

00:28:02.200 --> 00:28:03.870
They need to be washed.

00:28:03.870 --> 00:28:06.870
I'll go get the clothes from Yanagi-san.

00:28:08.240 --> 00:28:09.370
Fine.

00:28:09.370 --> 00:28:11.000
You know...

00:28:11.000 --> 00:28:15.500
Everyone else commutes between here and their respective homes,

00:28:15.500 --> 00:28:20.340
but I asked Mogari-san to let me live here.

00:28:20.340 --> 00:28:23.340
Because of that, my room is... next to yours.

00:28:24.140 --> 00:28:26.050
So, um...

00:28:26.850 --> 00:28:28.260
Um-

00:28:30.480 --> 00:28:38.690
Um... if you're having any trouble or need anything, let me know.

00:28:41.950 --> 00:28:45.320
There's nothing I need, but there is a place I want to go.

00:29:17.980 --> 00:29:19.570
Why are you following me?

00:29:22.110 --> 00:29:24.030
Why are you coming with me?

00:29:25.490 --> 00:29:29.700
It's dangerous to be alone... well, maybe not...

00:29:29.700 --> 00:29:31.740
But you see, a mobile phone.

00:29:31.740 --> 00:29:33.960
You don’t have a mobile phone.

00:29:33.960 --> 00:29:38.500
You can't receive calls from SIRRUT, 
which is why... You get it, right?

00:29:40.420 --> 00:29:43.550
Do you want to have another encounter like yesterday?

00:29:43.550 --> 00:29:46.930
But... I want us to be together

00:29:46.930 --> 00:29:48.090
Why?

00:29:48.090 --> 00:29:49.550
I don't know...

00:30:06.570 --> 00:30:11.530
I didn't think there'd be a house like this in these parts.

00:30:12.200 --> 00:30:13.750
Don't you see it?

00:30:14.620 --> 00:30:15.660
See what?

00:30:15.660 --> 00:30:17.670
Am I missing something?

00:30:22.800 --> 00:30:24.510
It's not a house.

00:30:24.510 --> 00:30:25.630
It's a shop.

00:30:37.440 --> 00:30:39.650
Long time no see, Saya.

00:30:42.360 --> 00:30:44.690
It’s only been 6 months.

00:30:53.410 --> 00:30:57.040
It's been a while since I've seen this side of you, Saya.

00:31:42.080 --> 00:31:42.960
Here you go.

00:31:43.500 --> 00:31:45.250
Thank you.

00:31:48.460 --> 00:31:49.420
Saya.

00:31:51.010 --> 00:31:52.140
I won't have any.

00:31:58.390 --> 00:31:59.640
It's good...

00:31:59.640 --> 00:32:01.270
That's good to hear.

00:32:02.230 --> 00:32:05.060
What do you do here in this shop?

00:32:05.360 --> 00:32:07.530
It's a shop for granting wishes.

00:32:10.030 --> 00:32:11.820
You could say I'm a merchant.

00:32:15.030 --> 00:32:17.990
Are you a regular here?

00:32:17.990 --> 00:32:19.830
I've only been here a few times.

00:32:19.830 --> 00:32:22.710
Because there's something in here I want.

00:32:22.710 --> 00:32:26.920
Though, Saya coming here with someone...

00:32:26.920 --> 00:32:28.340
That <i>is</i> surprising.

00:32:28.340 --> 00:32:31.050
I just followed her.

00:32:31.050 --> 00:32:33.760
Only because she let you.

00:32:36.430 --> 00:32:43.640
At Ukishima, I was able to be near her, but I can't say I was of any help.

00:32:43.640 --> 00:32:46.650
You brought yourself back on your own.

00:32:46.650 --> 00:32:51.650
Even so, your words helped me.

00:32:51.650 --> 00:32:53.700
In that case, what brings you today?

00:32:54.530 --> 00:32:57.490
I'd like another katana.

00:32:57.490 --> 00:32:59.790
A strong katana.

00:33:07.840 --> 00:33:11.050
Amazing, there are so many.

00:33:37.280 --> 00:33:39.740
I thought you'd choose that one.

00:33:45.290 --> 00:33:46.670
How much for it?

00:33:52.260 --> 00:33:53.880
You can pay me when you return.

00:33:55.550 --> 00:33:56.800
Understood.

00:33:59.390 --> 00:34:01.010
Ah, wait up!

00:34:10.940 --> 00:34:14.530
Would you mind staying by Saya's side?

00:34:16.320 --> 00:34:18.320
But I...

00:34:18.700 --> 00:34:21.160
...feel I'm bringing trouble to her

00:34:21.160 --> 00:34:24.540
She let you come to the shop.

00:34:24.540 --> 00:34:26.370
That is more than enough.

00:34:29.080 --> 00:34:31.920
What is the relationship between you two?

00:34:31.920 --> 00:34:34.590
As merchant and customer.  That’s all.

00:34:34.590 --> 00:34:40.140
But you know, the longer people live, the more they learn to care about one another.

00:34:54.030 --> 00:34:59.450
Their fates are already intertwined.

00:34:59.450 --> 00:35:01.660
Wait up, Saya!

00:35:04.660 --> 00:35:07.160
<i>This is an announcement from the Metropolitan Government of Tokyo.</i>

00:35:07.710 --> 00:35:09.790
<i>It's past 20:00.</i>

00:35:09.790 --> 00:35:15.380
<i>In compliance with the Juvenile Protection Curfew Act, minors are to be prohibited</i>

00:35:15.380 --> 00:35:20.260
<i>from going out past 21:00 without company of their legal guardians or carrying the respective permit.</i>

00:35:20.930 --> 00:35:25.010
<i>Any minors who fail to comply with the listed requirements, please return home as soon as possible.</i>

00:35:25.890 --> 00:35:28.640
<i>This is an announcement from the Metropolitan Government of Tokyo.</i>

00:35:28.640 --> 00:35:30.560
<i>It's past 20:00.</i>

00:35:34.320 --> 00:35:36.030
I'm sorry for using the phone.

00:35:36.030 --> 00:35:39.200
I thought I'd inform the others...

00:35:39.200 --> 00:35:40.400
About what?

00:35:41.160 --> 00:35:42.280
That.

00:35:42.820 --> 00:35:44.490
The area that's under surveillance.

00:35:44.490 --> 00:35:47.160
They just announced it, right?

00:35:47.160 --> 00:35:52.880
After 9 PM, minors like us can't go outside without permission.

00:35:54.210 --> 00:35:56.170
Hey, it's time for you to go home.

00:36:03.010 --> 00:36:07.350
That's why rumours about you started spreading on the internet.

00:36:08.640 --> 00:36:12.310
Miyakojima

00:36:08.640 --> 00:36:12.310
Let's go!

00:36:10.600 --> 00:36:12.940
A mysterious girl striding around town alone,

00:36:12.940 --> 00:36:15.520
despite looking like a minor.

00:36:20.650 --> 00:36:22.860
No one would take rumours like that lightly.

00:36:22.860 --> 00:36:26.330
Information not only about Seventh Heaven,

00:36:26.330 --> 00:36:30.710
but also about Tower can be found through these rumours.

00:36:30.710 --> 00:36:33.000
We suspect that the new regulations are also aimed at suppressing these rumours.

00:36:33.830 --> 00:36:38.420
Nowadays, the internet is much faster than any broadcast or newspaper,

00:36:38.420 --> 00:36:41.420
so they can't really hide or fabricate information.

00:36:41.420 --> 00:36:46.260
And the people who best know the internet and are online the most are...

00:36:47.600 --> 00:36:49.720
...minors, right?

00:36:51.100 --> 00:36:54.850
The same kids who will shape the future of Japan...

00:36:54.850 --> 00:36:59.110
...would not to question the current government, or Tower.

00:36:59.110 --> 00:37:01.740
That's what Mogari-san said.

00:37:01.740 --> 00:37:06.200
But I wonder what they hope to achieve by going so far.

00:37:07.450 --> 00:37:10.540
This "Nanahara Fumito" is...

00:37:10.540 --> 00:37:14.080
S-Sorry, I've been talking this whole time...

00:37:14.710 --> 00:37:16.380
Hey, you two!

00:37:22.340 --> 00:37:23.470
What's the matter?

00:37:23.470 --> 00:37:26.340
It's only just past 8pm...

00:37:26.970 --> 00:37:29.050
This isn't about the time.

00:37:29.050 --> 00:37:30.430
You there.

00:37:30.430 --> 00:37:33.560
I'm sorry, but could you show me your identification card?

00:37:33.560 --> 00:37:35.560
There's something I want to confirm...

00:37:35.560 --> 00:37:38.270
Oi, wait!

00:37:38.270 --> 00:37:40.860
Don't walk away from us.

00:37:46.160 --> 00:37:47.360
You brat!

00:38:03.510 --> 00:38:06.970
Number 315, please report in.

00:38:08.010 --> 00:38:11.310
315, please report in.

00:38:11.640 --> 00:38:14.140
She really is amazing...

00:38:14.140 --> 00:38:15.770
What are you doing?

00:38:15.770 --> 00:38:17.520
We have to get away from here.

00:38:25.150 --> 00:38:26.740
That's why I told you...

00:38:27.610 --> 00:38:29.950
...it was dangerous, didn't I?!

00:38:29.950 --> 00:38:31.330
I'm sorry!

00:38:32.950 --> 00:38:37.080
Don't tell me we've been exposed...

00:38:37.080 --> 00:38:38.870
I don't think so.

00:38:38.870 --> 00:38:41.790
They only wanted to talk to Saya.

00:38:41.790 --> 00:38:43.880
Why only Saya-san?

00:38:45.050 --> 00:38:49.220
But she dealt with the inspectors all too quickly.

00:38:49.220 --> 00:38:51.850
So they never even got to touch me.

00:38:51.850 --> 00:38:53.640
Thank goodness.

00:38:53.640 --> 00:38:55.600
Thank you, Tsuki-chan.

00:38:55.600 --> 00:38:58.810
Hiiragi, if that happens again, you should just run away.

00:38:58.810 --> 00:39:01.230
Just leave that wretch behind.

00:39:02.060 --> 00:39:04.440
But she's so pretty...

00:39:04.440 --> 00:39:06.280
She's not my type.

00:39:06.280 --> 00:39:09.820
Yanagi-san's more your type, isn't she?

00:39:09.820 --> 00:39:12.950
T-That's not it, you idiot!

00:39:14.450 --> 00:39:17.330
You really should have ran without her.

00:39:17.330 --> 00:39:23.040
I guess I'd only be in the way if I stayed, huh?

00:39:23.040 --> 00:39:24.630
You couldn't leave her behind?

00:39:25.960 --> 00:39:28.550
I guess not.

00:39:33.220 --> 00:39:39.180
Mana-chan, I couldn't find anything about your father, sorry

00:39:39.730 --> 00:39:41.770
It's been four months now, right?

00:39:42.520 --> 00:39:43.560
Forgive me.

00:39:48.360 --> 00:39:49.900
I think we should-

00:39:49.900 --> 00:39:51.160
It'll be fine!

00:39:51.450 --> 00:39:56.660
Mana, I'll try hard enough for the both of us!

00:39:56.660 --> 00:39:58.790
So, Mana will...

00:40:00.210 --> 00:40:01.580
Tsuki-chan...

00:40:05.920 --> 00:40:07.590
You're right!

00:40:07.590 --> 00:40:10.340
Yeah, we're a team!

00:40:10.340 --> 00:40:12.340
We'll expose all the evils in the world!

00:40:12.340 --> 00:40:14.430
SIRRUT!

00:40:14.430 --> 00:40:17.310
We won't let something like this bring us down!

00:40:15.050 --> 00:40:17.770
Thank you... everyone.

00:40:28.400 --> 00:40:30.950
A katana, eh?

00:40:30.950 --> 00:40:32.150
And with that...

00:40:36.910 --> 00:40:39.370
...you'll kill Fumito, right?

00:40:40.660 --> 00:40:41.830
That's right.

00:40:42.830 --> 00:40:45.500
Mogari-san, within SIRRUT...

00:40:45.500 --> 00:40:49.000
No, carrying weapons within this building is...

00:40:49.000 --> 00:40:50.460
It's fine.

00:40:50.460 --> 00:40:54.340
Go make the preparations, and try not to arouse suspicion.

00:41:07.900 --> 00:41:09.230
May I call you "Saya"?

00:41:10.400 --> 00:41:12.030
Suit yourself.

00:41:12.030 --> 00:41:16.030
Well then, Saya, Tower is searching for you.

00:41:16.030 --> 00:41:18.780
According to information gathered by Tsukiyama-kun and the others,

00:41:18.780 --> 00:41:23.410
Tower is running a thorough search on you through Seventh Heaven.

00:41:23.410 --> 00:41:28.710
They've hired more inspectors within Tokyo, and are discreetly searching for you.

00:41:28.710 --> 00:41:33.050
It'd be for the best if you would avoid any incidents like the one from earlier.

00:41:33.050 --> 00:41:35.630
I do not intend to follow your orders.

00:41:35.630 --> 00:41:37.180
I know that.

00:41:37.180 --> 00:41:41.220
However, if you want to kill Fumito, you should wait for the opportune moment.

00:41:42.220 --> 00:41:46.440
I'll make sure you get the chance... no matter what.

00:41:48.440 --> 00:41:51.230
What happened between you and him?

00:41:54.320 --> 00:41:55.860
Fumito and I are...

00:41:57.110 --> 00:41:58.660
...cousins.

00:42:07.750 --> 00:42:09.290
Follow me.

00:42:13.760 --> 00:42:15.800
Do you know of the Shrovetide?

00:42:16.720 --> 00:42:17.470
Indeed.

00:42:18.300 --> 00:42:20.470
It's an agreement with the Elder Bairns.

00:42:20.470 --> 00:42:27.350
A pact that allows them to devour humans, but only a certain quantity.

00:42:27.350 --> 00:42:30.360
And that is the Shrovetide.

00:42:32.690 --> 00:42:41.530
Fumito and I are from the clan that has been hiding and protecting the Shrovetide for generations.

00:42:43.040 --> 00:42:44.540
That's right...

00:42:44.540 --> 00:42:48.040
We're descendants from the clan that made the pact with the Elder Bairns.

00:42:55.630 --> 00:43:00.180
On the surface, the Mogari family would manipulate the governments of each era,

00:43:00.180 --> 00:43:02.600
to ensure they would follow the agreement.

00:43:03.680 --> 00:43:08.140
And the Nanahara would, from the shadows, use the secret powers of Ugetsu to protect the Mogari.

00:43:08.140 --> 00:43:11.560
As a combination of the two, we were called "Tower".

00:43:12.520 --> 00:43:14.900
But then Fumito chose a different path.

00:43:27.370 --> 00:43:31.040
You're the first person I've shown this place to.

00:43:36.590 --> 00:43:42.850
Six years ago, Fumito came here with an armed military unit.

00:43:46.680 --> 00:43:50.600
His target was the Shrovetide.

00:43:55.770 --> 00:44:00.490
He killed my father and mother, the heads of the Mogari family.

00:44:03.320 --> 00:44:05.950
He took everything I had away from me...

00:44:10.410 --> 00:44:12.620
...right before of my eyes.

00:44:17.920 --> 00:44:19.130
Saya.

00:44:21.050 --> 00:44:22.470
You must...

00:44:23.720 --> 00:44:25.100
...kill Fumito.

00:44:30.390 --> 00:44:33.060
I am looking for Fumito...

00:44:33.810 --> 00:44:35.440
...for my own reasons.

00:44:37.320 --> 00:44:38.730
I understand.

00:44:39.570 --> 00:44:42.650
However, Fumito will be difficult to deal with.

00:44:42.650 --> 00:44:44.360
You hate him too, don't you?

00:45:30.290 --> 00:45:34.080
Welcome ba- or not.

00:45:39.500 --> 00:45:40.840
I...

00:45:40.840 --> 00:45:43.420
I wanted to thank you.

00:45:43.420 --> 00:45:44.420
For what?

00:45:44.880 --> 00:45:46.930
For saving me from those inspectors earlier.

00:45:46.930 --> 00:45:49.680
That was just because you happened to be involved.

00:45:49.680 --> 00:45:52.600
But you still saved me and we escaped. Thank-

00:46:04.280 --> 00:46:05.820
Now what?

00:46:05.820 --> 00:46:08.280
G-Good night.

00:46:18.540 --> 00:46:22.000
I'll have to talk to her more tomorrow.

00:46:22.000 --> 00:46:23.670
Even just a minute longer...

00:46:43.030 --> 00:46:43.900
Saya.

00:46:46.650 --> 00:46:48.160
Saya!

00:46:48.160 --> 00:46:49.780
Saya-chan.

00:46:49.780 --> 00:46:50.700
Saya.

00:46:50.700 --> 00:46:51.990
Saya.

00:46:51.990 --> 00:46:52.910
Saya-san!

00:46:53.200 --> 00:46:54.290
Saya.

00:46:54.450 --> 00:46:55.790
Saya!

00:46:55.790 --> 00:46:56.540
Saya!

00:46:56.540 --> 00:46:58.960
Saya!

00:46:57.460 --> 00:46:58.960
Saya!

00:47:18.140 --> 00:47:19.690
Stop it!

00:47:44.590 --> 00:47:45.710
Saya.

00:47:46.800 --> 00:47:51.890
When we were in Ukishima, and you had no memories, I loved you...

00:47:51.890 --> 00:47:53.510
Even so...

00:47:53.510 --> 00:47:55.470
...what really attracted me to you was....

00:47:55.930 --> 00:47:56.810
Fumito-sama.

00:47:58.310 --> 00:48:00.310
The preparations are complete.

00:48:01.400 --> 00:48:02.400
I see.

00:48:04.690 --> 00:48:09.360
We'll meet again very soon, Saya.

00:48:21.000 --> 00:48:24.840
What's with its adorable paws!?

00:48:26.800 --> 00:48:30.010
When will you start following the others' examples?

00:48:32.930 --> 00:48:36.600
Things related to computers or the Internet... Impossible.

00:48:37.640 --> 00:48:40.480
Sending emails is the most I can do.

00:48:40.480 --> 00:48:46.570
Even though I'm Mogari-san's secretary, I still provide this team with support.

00:48:46.570 --> 00:48:51.030
I'm not superhuman like you.

00:48:51.820 --> 00:48:53.490
You're not being adorable at all.

00:48:54.450 --> 00:48:56.660
I'm not trying to be adorable!

00:48:56.660 --> 00:49:00.250
I'm just a system driver that's in charge of 
troubleshooting all the troublesome matters!

00:49:09.920 --> 00:49:11.550
Seriously...

00:49:13.180 --> 00:49:15.760
What's wrong, Mana-chan?

00:49:17.100 --> 00:49:20.560
It didn't even last a minute....

00:49:22.020 --> 00:49:25.650
I'm so jealous that Matsuo-kun is so friendly with you.

00:49:28.520 --> 00:49:30.480
What are you talking about?

00:49:31.400 --> 00:49:33.450
You saying you don't like it?

00:49:34.400 --> 00:49:36.620
I didn't say that, did I?

00:49:36.620 --> 00:49:37.910
I did it!

00:49:40.120 --> 00:49:44.790
We've found some information on what could be one of Nanahara Fumito's plans!

00:49:47.790 --> 00:49:48.960
A high school?

00:49:48.960 --> 00:49:49.960
Yes.

00:49:51.760 --> 00:49:55.510
Seventh Heaven has been offering "gifts" to this school..

00:49:55.510 --> 00:49:57.760
Won't there be many structures just like that?

00:49:58.640 --> 00:50:03.890
Not just schools, but other charitable organisations, such as hospitals and orphanages.

00:50:04.230 --> 00:50:05.190
There's too many!

00:50:05.190 --> 00:50:09.230
Those? Tsuki-chan and I worked together to go through them.

00:50:09.230 --> 00:50:11.320
And then... bingo!

00:50:11.320 --> 00:50:12.400
You mean Tsuki-chan found it, right?

00:50:12.400 --> 00:50:14.070
Um, right...

00:50:16.780 --> 00:50:18.490
Tsuji Private School.

00:50:18.990 --> 00:50:22.910
Tomorrow, Nanahara Fumito will be giving a lecture there.

00:50:22.910 --> 00:50:25.870
It can't have been easy to get hold of this information.

00:50:25.870 --> 00:50:27.500
Well, you see...

00:50:27.500 --> 00:50:30.710
...we exploited loopholes in their network's security.

00:50:30.710 --> 00:50:32.380
You mean Tsuki-chan did, right?

00:50:38.050 --> 00:50:39.390
Is this information reliable?

00:50:42.060 --> 00:50:49.190
Other than hacking, I was also taught skills for verifying the reliability of information, that's why...

00:50:50.900 --> 00:50:53.150
What will you do, Saya?

00:50:54.230 --> 00:50:55.610
I'll go.

00:50:55.610 --> 00:50:57.030
Oi, oi!

00:50:57.030 --> 00:51:01.070
Won't this school have heavy security?

00:51:01.070 --> 00:51:05.660
If you try to just walk in, they won't let you past the gate, and nowhere near Fumito.

00:51:05.660 --> 00:51:09.120
About that, I-I've worked something out!

00:51:09.120 --> 00:51:11.840
I have all the information on their security.

00:51:11.840 --> 00:51:14.340
You work well if you put your mind to it, Fujimura-kun!

00:51:15.420 --> 00:51:17.920
What about their uniform?

00:51:17.920 --> 00:51:22.550
Even if you disguise yourself as a student, you'll never be able to get hold of one of their uniforms.

00:51:22.550 --> 00:51:25.310
To get one so soon... the lecture's tomorrow...

00:51:27.390 --> 00:51:29.480
I might be able to help.

00:52:00.260 --> 00:52:03.180
This rain's never gonna stop.

00:52:04.510 --> 00:52:06.510
Wait, Saya!

00:52:06.510 --> 00:52:08.480
Audio's good!

00:52:11.100 --> 00:52:13.940
The GPS is spot-on.

00:52:13.940 --> 00:52:18.570
Still, I never expected that Mana-chan was student at this School...

00:52:21.990 --> 00:52:28.160
Hiiragi managed to tell Mogari-san herself that she'd be going.

00:52:28.700 --> 00:52:31.620
Please let me go with Saya.

00:52:32.120 --> 00:52:33.500
Please!

00:52:34.460 --> 00:52:36.090
Saya.

00:52:41.380 --> 00:52:42.630
Do what you want.

00:52:45.760 --> 00:52:48.720
We should give it everything we've got as well.

00:52:48.720 --> 00:52:49.810
Yeah!

00:52:49.810 --> 00:52:51.020
You're right.

00:52:52.270 --> 00:52:56.770
If they encounter any danger, ensure you can charge in to the rescue, got it?

00:52:56.770 --> 00:52:57.650
Right!

00:53:01.150 --> 00:53:06.320
I know you're worried, but let's provide as much support as we can, okay?

00:53:06.740 --> 00:53:07.660
Okay.

00:53:15.540 --> 00:53:19.460
You make it seem like you're not a stranger here.

00:53:20.300 --> 00:53:22.550
I would stand out more if I looked out of place.

00:53:23.470 --> 00:53:24.720
You're probably right.

00:53:25.970 --> 00:53:27.260
Did you know?

00:53:28.850 --> 00:53:32.890
That this school had ties with them?

00:53:33.770 --> 00:53:34.770
Yeah.

00:53:35.230 --> 00:53:38.190
The school erected a stone monument to thank them.

00:53:38.190 --> 00:53:41.030
Our teachers told us about it.

00:53:43.570 --> 00:53:47.700
Actually, I wanted to leave this school, but...

00:53:50.200 --> 00:53:51.580
Hiiragi-san.

00:53:53.080 --> 00:53:54.960
You came.

00:53:54.960 --> 00:53:56.210
Yes.

00:53:56.210 --> 00:54:00.210
I figured you'd be resting, since it's still winter break.

00:54:00.880 --> 00:54:03.300
Living by yourself is difficult, isn't it?

00:54:03.300 --> 00:54:04.670
Are you okay?

00:54:05.300 --> 00:54:06.510
Sure.

00:54:06.510 --> 00:54:09.550
Your father seems to be in trouble, too, so I guess it can't be helped.

00:54:09.550 --> 00:54:11.930
But I'm glad you look so cheerful.

00:54:11.930 --> 00:54:14.430
The time! It's about to start.

00:54:15.810 --> 00:54:16.900
Let's go.

00:54:26.150 --> 00:54:30.450
I'm glad that we aren't seated according to class.

00:54:30.450 --> 00:54:32.910
Our school is generally like that.

00:54:32.910 --> 00:54:35.160
What were you talking about?

00:54:35.160 --> 00:54:36.710
About your father.

00:54:38.920 --> 00:54:40.540
No, it's nothing.

00:54:42.130 --> 00:54:43.920
Everyone, please listen up.

00:54:45.050 --> 00:54:48.930
The lecture will now begin.

00:54:48.930 --> 00:54:51.970
Nanahara Fumito has come to give this lecture.

00:54:52.720 --> 00:54:55.600
Nanahara... Seventh Heaven's...

00:54:55.600 --> 00:54:56.430
Are you serious?

00:54:57.020 --> 00:55:00.100
No wonder we couldn't bring our mobile phones.

00:55:20.290 --> 00:55:21.920
What's going on?

00:55:23.550 --> 00:55:25.670
Please calm down.

00:55:25.670 --> 00:55:29.180
Please follow our instructions while leaving.

00:55:31.300 --> 00:55:32.970
Let's hurry up and leave.

00:55:32.970 --> 00:55:34.100
Saya!

00:55:43.900 --> 00:55:45.070
Mana!

00:55:45.070 --> 00:55:46.280
What's happening?

00:55:47.400 --> 00:55:49.030
I don't know!

00:55:49.030 --> 00:55:51.450
Alarms went off, and people were screaming!

00:55:51.450 --> 00:55:54.120
But the school director's not moving at all!

00:55:59.120 --> 00:56:01.620
It's been a long time, Saya.

00:56:03.330 --> 00:56:04.000
Saya!

00:56:13.340 --> 00:56:16.390
Fumito!

00:56:23.150 --> 00:56:27.780
Saya, after coming this far... I'm sorry.

00:56:28.530 --> 00:56:34.700
You're strong, so I think it would be troublesome if things remain as they are.

00:56:34.700 --> 00:56:39.500
That's why... I'll play around with you a little.

00:56:53.470 --> 00:56:55.180
What...

00:56:55.180 --> 00:56:56.260
...am I doing?

00:56:56.800 --> 00:56:59.560
Saya! Saya!

00:58:22.020 --> 00:58:23.810
Saya!

00:58:31.690 --> 00:58:33.110
Mana!

00:58:42.370 --> 00:58:43.490
Saya.

00:58:44.410 --> 00:58:45.580
Saya!

00:58:46.500 --> 00:58:48.210
Saya!

00:58:48.210 --> 00:58:49.380
Matsu-san.

00:58:49.380 --> 00:58:50.130
Yeah!?

00:58:52.090 --> 00:58:53.710
Let's go!

00:58:54.380 --> 00:58:55.590
Fuji...

00:58:57.010 --> 00:58:59.800
Let's do this!

00:59:01.510 --> 00:59:03.930
N-No...

00:59:36.920 --> 00:59:38.380
Saya...

01:00:14.590 --> 01:00:15.960
Let's go, Mana!

01:00:16.420 --> 01:00:17.380
Ok.

01:00:32.230 --> 01:00:33.440
I'll go in.

01:00:34.360 --> 01:00:36.360
You guys, proceed with the collection.

01:00:46.910 --> 01:00:48.580
Saya, move aside please.

01:00:48.870 --> 01:00:50.540
I'll get it to open.

01:00:53.000 --> 01:00:54.710
So you are Saya?

01:00:57.630 --> 01:00:59.130
What's wrong?

01:00:59.630 --> 01:01:01.300
Does it hurt?

01:01:01.300 --> 01:01:03.470
You're no less a monster than that thing you killed.

01:01:03.470 --> 01:01:04.590
Shut up!

01:01:19.280 --> 01:01:20.190
Saya!

01:01:20.690 --> 01:01:22.900
Don't worry about me!

01:01:23.910 --> 01:01:25.490
This is the end.

01:01:35.500 --> 01:01:37.750
You're unable to kill humans, right?

01:01:42.880 --> 01:01:43.970
Saya!

01:01:47.680 --> 01:01:49.310
So...

01:01:49.310 --> 01:01:52.100
...how can you protect anyone?

01:02:00.730 --> 01:02:01.690
Get in!

01:02:02.690 --> 01:02:03.900
Move your arses!

01:02:15.830 --> 01:02:17.830
She needs treatment quickly!

01:02:23.260 --> 01:02:25.220
She escaped.

01:02:26.220 --> 01:02:27.800
Seems like it.

01:02:28.760 --> 01:02:31.720
The blood collection went exactly as planned.

01:02:32.140 --> 01:02:34.390
We'll send it to the lab now.

01:02:35.140 --> 01:02:36.730
Thanks for the hard work.

01:02:49.120 --> 01:02:51.870
In other words, we were tricked.

01:02:53.540 --> 01:02:54.700
I'm sorry...

01:02:55.830 --> 01:02:57.670
Tsuki-chan...

01:02:57.670 --> 01:02:59.880
It's not your fault.

01:03:01.210 --> 01:03:02.920
I handled the verification.

01:03:03.210 --> 01:03:05.090
Furthermore I authorised their plans.

01:03:06.170 --> 01:03:07.880
It's my fault.

01:03:08.630 --> 01:03:09.890
Mogari-san...

01:03:10.430 --> 01:03:14.180
But I'm glad the two of them came back safe.

01:03:14.890 --> 01:03:19.100
But my car got wrecked again...

01:03:19.400 --> 01:03:21.610
They're like battle scars.

01:03:21.610 --> 01:03:24.530
Well, someone <i>did</i> get hurt.

01:03:24.530 --> 01:03:29.110
In comparison, a few scratches are nothing...

01:03:29.110 --> 01:03:32.330
Didn't you say you hated Saya-san's guts?

01:03:33.080 --> 01:03:35.830
She was trying to protect Hiiragi, wasn't she?

01:03:35.830 --> 01:03:39.210
And she could have just left her there to die...

01:03:39.210 --> 01:03:43.040
I'm ready to think better of her now.

01:03:44.460 --> 01:03:46.170
How <i>is</i> Saya-san?

01:03:46.170 --> 01:03:48.420
She said she won't go to the hospital.

01:03:48.420 --> 01:03:50.630
So Hiiragi got angry and ran after her.

01:03:52.140 --> 01:03:56.310
By the way, wasn't it Mana-chan who disengaged the lock in the lecture hall?

01:03:56.310 --> 01:03:57.730
I think you're right.

01:03:58.930 --> 01:04:01.600
Mana... hacked the lock?

01:04:02.270 --> 01:04:04.020
The situation demanded it.

01:04:04.020 --> 01:04:06.480
And she did it so quickly...

01:04:06.480 --> 01:04:07.940
As we'd expect of her.

01:04:08.400 --> 01:04:10.950
Now we have someone to help out our outstanding hackers.

01:04:11.240 --> 01:04:12.490
That's not true!

01:04:12.950 --> 01:04:14.910
Mana's the outstanding one!

01:04:14.910 --> 01:04:17.750
The best I can do is follow what she taught me.

01:04:17.750 --> 01:04:19.910
I can't compare with her at all.

01:04:21.500 --> 01:04:25.960
Will this lead to you becoming a hacker again, Mana?

01:04:32.640 --> 01:04:33.840
No!

01:04:34.600 --> 01:04:36.220
Stop it!

01:04:37.430 --> 01:04:40.270
You can't possibly be fine after suffering such an injury!

01:04:40.270 --> 01:04:42.600
It's nothing to worry about.

01:04:42.600 --> 01:04:43.900
Saya!

01:04:55.410 --> 01:04:57.580
I'm really sorry.

01:04:58.660 --> 01:05:00.620
You don't have to apologise.

01:05:02.870 --> 01:05:05.040
But... I...

01:05:05.670 --> 01:05:07.630
It's my fault...

01:05:08.840 --> 01:05:10.550
I've had enough.

01:05:15.430 --> 01:05:18.390
Really, I'm fine.

01:05:24.980 --> 01:05:27.440
They're healed?

01:05:28.020 --> 01:05:29.730
What?

01:05:29.730 --> 01:05:31.530
You keep asking "why".

01:05:31.530 --> 01:05:33.700
I'll be fine.

01:05:33.700 --> 01:05:35.160
Do you understand?

01:05:38.490 --> 01:05:41.120
"I've had enough", you say?

01:05:41.830 --> 01:05:43.750
Has something like this happened before?

01:05:55.130 --> 01:06:00.760
My mother passed away when I was young, and I've only had my father since then.

01:06:00.760 --> 01:06:07.730
My father is a terrible cook, but he tried his best to learn how to for me.

01:06:07.730 --> 01:06:14.490
Even when his work was overwhelming, he gave his all for my sake.

01:06:15.610 --> 01:06:18.620
My father was a journalist.

01:06:20.740 --> 01:06:27.790
He would love to read old newspapers from before articles were all-digital.

01:06:29.250 --> 01:06:36.840
When we met, occasionally, he would say that journalists needed a sense of curiosity and to have inquisitive minds.

01:06:37.720 --> 01:06:42.600
He also said that they should be knowledgeable about various things, remain unaffected by the information around them,

01:06:42.600 --> 01:06:45.270
and provide thorough coverage of the news.

01:06:45.940 --> 01:06:52.570
He often told me that once I make a decision, I should never falter until it's seen to the end.

01:06:55.190 --> 01:07:01.160
A year ago, father... decided to make a story targeting Seventh Heaven.

01:07:01.780 --> 01:07:06.830
But... his superiors soon put pressure on him, and his work was halted.

01:07:06.830 --> 01:07:09.790
But my father wouldn't have it.

01:07:09.790 --> 01:07:14.840
He said that he would continue to write the article, even if he was on his own.

01:07:17.050 --> 01:07:21.970
I thought I might have been able to help him, so I did some research of my own.

01:07:24.060 --> 01:07:28.140
I only tried because of my confidence in my skills with a computer.

01:07:30.270 --> 01:07:33.230
I got past Seventh Heaven's security system.

01:07:33.230 --> 01:07:39.700
But that's when I found out how many people had disappeared from there.

01:07:41.120 --> 01:07:46.950
I also learned of the existence of "Tower".

01:07:47.830 --> 01:07:52.080
After I shared the evidence, my father went to expose Nanahara Fumito.

01:07:53.340 --> 01:07:56.760
"Thank you", he said to me...

01:07:58.340 --> 01:07:59.680
And just like that...

01:08:01.470 --> 01:08:03.430
...he disappeared forever.

01:08:04.560 --> 01:08:07.850
If only I hadn't done what I did!

01:08:07.850 --> 01:08:10.560
Father... my father...

01:08:12.020 --> 01:08:14.690
...never came back,

01:08:15.150 --> 01:08:17.440
and it was all my fault!

01:08:18.990 --> 01:08:22.740
I joined this organisation so I could search for my father.

01:08:22.740 --> 01:08:26.830
But I was afraid to find out the truth, so I couldn't focus on hacking.

01:08:27.450 --> 01:08:31.000
I don't know what I'd do if I found out that my father had died.

01:08:41.930 --> 01:08:44.220
What about your father?

01:08:44.800 --> 01:08:45.800
I don't have one.

01:08:46.310 --> 01:08:49.980
However, I did have someone who was like a father to me.

01:08:53.520 --> 01:08:55.480
He was a kind person.

01:08:59.190 --> 01:09:02.150
Why are you so strong?

01:09:04.660 --> 01:09:06.870
I'm like your father.

01:09:08.200 --> 01:09:13.870
When I make my decisions, I never falter and see them through to the end.

01:09:13.870 --> 01:09:19.460
I made up my mind to do that, in order for me to be true to myself.

01:09:22.680 --> 01:09:23.760
I get it know...

01:09:24.800 --> 01:09:28.350
Why I'm so attached to you.

01:09:29.260 --> 01:09:32.140
We're the same, aren't we?

01:09:33.390 --> 01:09:34.850
Our feelings of loneliness...

01:09:47.120 --> 01:09:51.620
As I expected, there are no reports anywhere about the incident at the school yesterday.

01:09:52.160 --> 01:09:54.120
Geez... damn it!

01:09:55.330 --> 01:09:59.000
Mana-san and Saya-san didn't come, did they?

01:09:59.000 --> 01:10:01.340
With the severity of those injuries?

01:10:01.340 --> 01:10:04.340
I bet Mana-chan's taking care of her...

01:10:04.340 --> 01:10:07.470
Even so, she should go to a hospital.

01:10:08.720 --> 01:10:10.180
Good morning.

01:10:10.720 --> 01:10:11.850
Morning!

01:10:11.850 --> 01:10:13.370
Hey, you're lat-

01:10:14.270 --> 01:10:14.890
Sorry.

01:10:15.730 --> 01:10:18.360
I stayed up late last night.

01:10:19.940 --> 01:10:22.320
Good morning, Tsuki-chan.

01:10:25.900 --> 01:10:27.320
Mana!

01:10:30.740 --> 01:10:34.790
I'm sorry for giving you erroneous information.

01:10:35.540 --> 01:10:38.250
I hope you didn't lie to us on purpose.

01:10:38.250 --> 01:10:40.090
Of course not!

01:10:41.630 --> 01:10:43.300
Then it's fine.

01:10:44.380 --> 01:10:46.630
As long as you didn't mean to, it's okay.

01:10:51.140 --> 01:10:53.350
Does it hurt?

01:10:53.890 --> 01:10:54.730
No.

01:10:54.730 --> 01:10:55.930
Really?

01:10:55.930 --> 01:10:56.690
Yeah.

01:10:57.560 --> 01:11:00.230
It'd be nice if your injuries recovered quickly.

01:11:05.860 --> 01:11:09.070
Um, how do I put this?

01:11:09.070 --> 01:11:12.790
I may not have been entirely right about you.

01:11:12.790 --> 01:11:15.700
How can you be so arrogant when apologising?

01:11:15.700 --> 01:11:16.960
Shut up!

01:11:19.000 --> 01:11:22.590
Anyway, you protected Hiiragi.

01:11:22.590 --> 01:11:24.170
Thanks!

01:11:27.260 --> 01:11:29.430
Wha- ignoring me?!

01:11:29.430 --> 01:11:30.840
Now, now.

01:11:31.760 --> 01:11:35.930
Everyone, there's something I'd like you all to hear.

01:11:37.560 --> 01:11:39.140
Hacking?

01:11:39.390 --> 01:11:40.400
Yes.

01:11:41.190 --> 01:11:43.610
Are you sure, Mana-san?

01:11:48.240 --> 01:11:49.860
I'll be fine.

01:11:49.860 --> 01:11:56.620
I understand that if I keep running away, I won't be able to advance, regardless of the outcome...

01:11:57.500 --> 01:11:58.710
Hiiragi...

01:11:59.750 --> 01:12:00.750
I understand.

01:12:03.670 --> 01:12:07.050
After the incident at Tsuji School, Tower will-

01:12:07.050 --> 01:12:08.380
No...

01:12:08.380 --> 01:12:11.010
Fumito will make his move to eliminate us.

01:12:11.720 --> 01:12:16.720
Will Tower's hand reach us first, or will we be able to suppress them before that?

01:12:17.470 --> 01:12:19.350
I would like everyone to keep this in mind.

01:12:19.350 --> 01:12:20.730
Yes, sir!

01:12:36.660 --> 01:12:40.500
You seem to have a habit of stealing the hearts of those around you.

01:12:45.290 --> 01:12:48.550
I've done nothing.

01:12:53.550 --> 01:12:56.760
"Ask, and it shall be given you.

01:12:57.310 --> 01:13:00.430
Seek, and ye shall find.

01:13:00.430 --> 01:13:04.350
Knock, and it shall be opened unto you."

01:13:04.350 --> 01:13:08.320
People will seek answers on their own.

01:13:10.150 --> 01:13:13.570
Saya, have you found yours?

01:14:20.390 --> 01:14:22.770
Saya, you prepared this for me?

01:14:22.770 --> 01:14:25.440
All I did was pour the cup.

01:14:25.440 --> 01:14:26.810
Thanks.

01:14:29.020 --> 01:14:30.690
Would you care to join me?

01:14:31.650 --> 01:14:34.360
This... Mogari-san prepared it.

01:14:34.360 --> 01:14:38.490
He said he's grateful to us for giving our best.

01:14:38.490 --> 01:14:41.120
He also said you should drink some.

01:14:53.260 --> 01:14:54.800
Won't you rest?

01:14:54.800 --> 01:14:58.470
When I feel like I'm about to uncover something, I just can't.

01:14:58.470 --> 01:15:04.980
Besides, much like you with your power, this is my weapon.

01:15:04.980 --> 01:15:06.690
I see.

01:15:21.120 --> 01:15:22.370
What's the matter?!

01:15:37.340 --> 01:15:38.930
I see it!

01:15:40.930 --> 01:15:42.470
Tower's headquarters!

01:15:50.060 --> 01:15:53.110
Tokyo Bay Coastal Breakwater Landfill?

01:15:55.900 --> 01:15:58.400
She was so awesome!

01:15:58.860 --> 01:16:02.870
She was obliterating whatever security programs got in her way!

01:16:03.580 --> 01:16:07.160
Why didn't you wake me up so I could watch too!?

01:16:08.250 --> 01:16:10.750
However, there's nothing there...

01:16:11.580 --> 01:16:17.210
It doesn't appear in a search, but it does in an aerial view.

01:16:24.810 --> 01:16:26.430
There's nothing?

01:16:26.430 --> 01:16:30.480
The satellite view has false data embedded in it.

01:16:30.480 --> 01:16:32.060
Now if I were to remove it.

01:16:33.230 --> 01:16:34.360
Oh!

01:16:34.820 --> 01:16:36.020
Amazing.

01:16:36.730 --> 01:16:38.860
Truly, that's a job well done.

01:16:41.200 --> 01:16:44.830
Saya, Fumito is there.

01:17:00.130 --> 01:17:04.970
How they were able to hide such a large base amazes me.

01:17:04.970 --> 01:17:09.930
It's also amazing that we were able to find it, right?

01:17:12.190 --> 01:17:13.940
Definitely.

01:17:13.940 --> 01:17:17.020
Is going with you really out of the question?

01:17:17.020 --> 01:17:18.020
Definitely.

01:17:18.900 --> 01:17:21.030
They'll be armed.

01:17:21.030 --> 01:17:23.110
You are no match for them.

01:17:23.110 --> 01:17:24.950
But you will…

01:17:24.950 --> 01:17:26.120
You saw me.

01:17:26.120 --> 01:17:28.700
Minor injuries are nothing.

01:17:29.580 --> 01:17:33.830
Also, there are things you must deal with using <i>your</i> weapon.

01:17:36.750 --> 01:17:38.000
You're right.

01:17:38.000 --> 01:17:40.300
I have to find my father.

01:17:46.180 --> 01:17:49.510
We can't offer anything but support, so we'll give it our best!

01:17:49.510 --> 01:17:51.100
Are Tsuki-chan and Yanagi-san ready?

01:17:51.890 --> 01:17:53.770
They're ready and on standby.

01:17:59.480 --> 01:18:01.480
Let us know if anything happens.

01:18:01.480 --> 01:18:03.820
We'll hold here for long as possible.

01:18:03.820 --> 01:18:06.570
If you think you can’t go on, just come back.

01:18:08.580 --> 01:18:09.660
Thank you.

01:18:14.920 --> 01:18:17.790
Okay, let's go get them.

01:19:03.920 --> 01:19:05.340
Where's the target?

01:19:17.480 --> 01:19:18.850
It's starting!

01:19:19.650 --> 01:19:23.480
Fuji-kun, make sure our audio won't cut off.

01:19:23.480 --> 01:19:24.610
Okay.

01:19:31.070 --> 01:19:33.950
Tsuki-chan, can you tell me what's going on inside?

01:19:34.370 --> 01:19:37.000
I've tapped their wireless communications.

01:19:37.000 --> 01:19:38.540
Can you determine how many people are inside?

01:19:38.540 --> 01:19:39.290
Yes.

01:20:05.280 --> 01:20:08.780
Saya, I've got the number of people and their locations.

01:20:08.780 --> 01:20:11.110
There are more and more of them as the floors go up.

01:20:11.450 --> 01:20:13.580
Nanahara Fumito would be on the uppermost floor.

01:20:15.040 --> 01:20:16.410
No.

01:20:17.370 --> 01:20:20.500
Fumito has something more powerful than humans.

01:20:20.500 --> 01:20:23.290
Why would they need wireless communications?

01:20:23.290 --> 01:20:24.540
The Elder Bairns.

01:20:27.260 --> 01:20:28.720
Which area has the least people?

01:20:30.470 --> 01:20:31.180
The basement.

01:20:31.630 --> 01:20:32.470
Where is the entrance?

01:20:32.470 --> 01:20:33.550
Wait.

01:20:52.320 --> 01:20:53.820
Is that Fumito's talisman?

01:20:56.580 --> 01:20:57.790
Saya?

01:20:59.080 --> 01:21:00.210
Continue.

01:21:07.550 --> 01:21:10.470
I won't let you reach Fumito-sama!

01:21:21.350 --> 01:21:24.690
You look miserable, Kisaragi Saya.

01:21:27.770 --> 01:21:31.740
Don't you dare... call me that!

01:21:40.080 --> 01:21:42.120
I found a way to reach the basement.

01:21:42.750 --> 01:21:46.330
Go to the end of the elevator hall, and take the door on the right.

01:21:46.920 --> 01:21:47.790
Saya?

01:21:49.960 --> 01:21:52.300
Kutou, that's enough.

01:21:57.850 --> 01:22:00.310
Yes, Fumito-sama.

01:22:02.850 --> 01:22:08.060
Behold, this is the power of someone who can control everything.

01:22:53.230 --> 01:22:54.440
What's this sound?

01:22:54.440 --> 01:22:55.990
What the hell is going on?

01:22:55.990 --> 01:22:58.360
Saya, make a run for it.

01:22:58.360 --> 01:22:59.700
Hurry! Saya!

01:23:15.970 --> 01:23:18.760
Saya, take your next left.

01:23:26.520 --> 01:23:29.650
You can go down all the way to the bottom from there.

01:23:47.290 --> 01:23:48.750
Saya?

01:23:48.750 --> 01:23:50.710
I'm fine, don't worry.

01:24:38.590 --> 01:24:41.300
Good evening, Saya.

01:24:45.560 --> 01:24:47.060
This is...

01:24:50.690 --> 01:24:52.310
What on earth...

01:24:53.310 --> 01:24:54.560
...is this?

01:24:55.900 --> 01:24:56.930
Stop it...

01:24:58.650 --> 01:24:59.990
Stop it.

01:25:01.610 --> 01:25:02.410
Saya?

01:25:02.410 --> 01:25:04.820
Saya, what's wrong? Saya!?

01:25:07.240 --> 01:25:09.700
Saya? Saya!

01:25:10.790 --> 01:25:11.540
Fuji!

01:25:12.250 --> 01:25:14.500
It's no use, the feed's dead!

01:25:19.460 --> 01:25:22.800
Since we've finally met, I wanted to make sure we weren't disturbed...

01:25:22.800 --> 01:25:26.010
I made it so you won't be able to use wireless communication.

01:25:26.010 --> 01:25:27.310
I'm sorry.

01:25:28.640 --> 01:25:35.270
It's great that you came to see me, but for you to wreak such havoc everywhere is troublesome.

01:25:48.120 --> 01:25:51.250
It's finally working, Kuroto.

01:25:52.330 --> 01:25:55.210
I slipped her the amount you told me to.

01:25:55.920 --> 01:25:58.960
Why is it only affecting her now after all this time?

01:25:58.960 --> 01:26:00.250
What's with her?

01:26:10.430 --> 01:26:13.940
That cup of... coffee...

01:26:17.150 --> 01:26:21.940
Why must I be the one to give her such a thing?

01:26:21.940 --> 01:26:27.620
The youths you keep at your place are good kids who possess a strong sense of justice.

01:26:27.620 --> 01:26:31.540
They wouldn't agree to do it, would they?

01:26:33.580 --> 01:26:38.130
It's something that wouldn't work on humans, but only on you, Saya.

01:26:38.790 --> 01:26:41.550
Do you care about the members of SIRRUT?

01:26:41.550 --> 01:26:46.720
You became too trusting of them, and that's why I was able to lure you out.

01:26:47.220 --> 01:26:50.510
You were wary. You never even ate anything you were offered...

01:26:50.510 --> 01:26:53.980
...yet you drank the coffee.

01:26:53.980 --> 01:26:56.770
In the end, they were quite useful.

01:26:57.560 --> 01:26:59.360
Don’t misunderstand.

01:26:59.360 --> 01:27:04.740
I did not deceive them; I simply used them.

01:27:05.190 --> 01:27:14.330
SIRRUT started as a small internet circle that wanted more freedom here in Japan... specifically, Tokyo

01:27:15.620 --> 01:27:22.460
Well, we could've left them alone, but you know how much ideals spread over the internet.

01:27:22.460 --> 01:27:27.720
Which is why I offered to become a patron for their little circle.

01:27:29.090 --> 01:27:34.350
It made things easier since those brats believed any information I leaked.

01:27:34.720 --> 01:27:40.100
In addition, they lured you in, and you waltzed right into our plans.

01:27:41.480 --> 01:27:48.610
I didn't think Hiiragi would actually find this place.

01:27:49.360 --> 01:27:53.530
Needless to say, I contacted Fumito immediately.

01:27:54.540 --> 01:27:57.500
So, what will you do, Fumito?

01:27:57.500 --> 01:28:02.170
Why are you spending so much time and money on one woman like this?

01:28:03.210 --> 01:28:05.920
Saya's very special, isn't she?

01:28:06.300 --> 01:28:11.220
Special enough for you to use so much of Seventh Heaven's money and Tower's strength?

01:28:14.010 --> 01:28:24.150
You said we would take over the world with your connections and power, and seize control of Tower by killing off our families.

01:28:24.150 --> 01:28:25.400
Yes, I did.

01:28:26.280 --> 01:28:30.530
We can expect even more money, power and fame ahead.

01:28:30.910 --> 01:28:32.620
I don’t need any of that.

01:28:33.870 --> 01:28:36.660
I said I wanted to control the world.

01:28:37.700 --> 01:28:39.620
That’s why larger...

01:28:39.620 --> 01:28:43.210
The world is small.

01:28:43.210 --> 01:28:47.340
It really is... isn't it, Saya?

01:28:48.300 --> 01:28:50.720
This woman is the one?

01:28:59.060 --> 01:29:02.230
You're so careless, Fumito.

01:29:03.150 --> 01:29:05.820
Die here with this monster.

01:29:06.650 --> 01:29:09.440
I'll make it look like she killed you.

01:29:09.440 --> 01:29:11.780
Then I'll take everything.

01:29:13.660 --> 01:29:16.080
You underestimate me, cousin.

01:29:17.030 --> 01:29:19.160
You've always been like this.

01:29:19.160 --> 01:29:21.540
How dare you look down on me?

01:29:21.540 --> 01:29:22.960
That expression infuriates me!

01:29:33.470 --> 01:29:34.760
Fumito, you...!

01:29:35.850 --> 01:29:40.100
I will take back the promise I made to you.

01:29:41.930 --> 01:29:43.230
This is...!

01:29:44.850 --> 01:29:46.650
It's Saya’s blood.

01:29:48.980 --> 01:29:53.530
Look, he's joined the Shrovetide.

01:29:58.330 --> 01:30:02.330
Kuroto, there's the power you've been seeking.

01:30:03.460 --> 01:30:05.460
Feel it flowing through you.

01:30:10.090 --> 01:30:20.770
Saya, the power to control the Elder Bairns was inherited by the heads of the Mogari family.

01:30:21.810 --> 01:30:28.230
Your blood... it's the only thing that can close the gap between Elder Bairns and humans.

01:30:40.990 --> 01:30:46.420
Saya, as I thought, people never change.

01:30:46.420 --> 01:30:48.540
They are born that way.

01:30:49.500 --> 01:30:52.050
You are unable to kill humans.

01:30:52.050 --> 01:30:53.510
Because you aren't human.

01:30:54.670 --> 01:31:01.350
The only thing that can satisfy your hunger is an Elder Bairn, one of your own.

01:31:02.140 --> 01:31:10.690
Did you know that the human population is growing as rapidly as the Elder Bairn are disappearing?

01:31:10.690 --> 01:31:13.940
Soon, there may be no need for the Shrovetide.

01:31:15.030 --> 01:31:19.320
Saya, how old are you now?

01:31:19.320 --> 01:31:23.910
How many more years... no, how many more lifetimes will you live?

01:31:23.910 --> 01:31:27.160
During that time, the Elder Bairns will be no more.

01:31:27.750 --> 01:31:31.500
How, then, will you survive?

01:31:32.710 --> 01:31:33.880
Your blood.

01:31:34.460 --> 01:31:39.470
I've been trying to use Tower's power to turn humans into Elder Bairns.

01:31:40.090 --> 01:31:42.140
However, all attempts have failed.

01:31:42.140 --> 01:31:44.390
They quickly die.

01:31:44.390 --> 01:31:51.190
I am doing my best... to gather people and missing persons.

01:31:55.860 --> 01:31:58.150
Mana-chan, was it?

01:31:58.900 --> 01:32:01.280
I saw the video from Mogari mansion.

01:32:01.280 --> 01:32:03.280
Her father was a reporter, wasn't he?

01:32:06.200 --> 01:32:14.050
He survived longer, but once he escaped, he was done for...

01:32:15.000 --> 01:32:15.550
Him...

01:32:18.130 --> 01:32:23.600
He had his head stabbed through the moment you reached Tokyo.

01:32:24.060 --> 01:32:25.770
Right, Saya?

01:32:49.460 --> 01:32:51.750
What's going on?

01:33:00.470 --> 01:33:04.510
You really are as beautiful as I remember, Saya.

01:33:04.510 --> 01:33:06.600
To the victor the spoils.

01:33:08.270 --> 01:33:13.440
This is the greatest power that I can create.

01:33:20.650 --> 01:33:26.740
Previously, I could only run, but now look.

01:34:29.050 --> 01:34:30.560
Elder Bairns...

01:35:08.890 --> 01:35:10.720
Those eyes.

01:35:10.720 --> 01:35:14.180
They are the same as when I shot you.

01:35:14.850 --> 01:35:17.140
They are so beautiful.

01:35:17.140 --> 01:35:19.440
I want you, Saya.

01:35:20.020 --> 01:35:22.650
Fumito!

01:36:28.130 --> 01:36:29.470
Fumito...

01:36:30.970 --> 01:36:34.430
Why are you doing this?

01:36:43.150 --> 01:36:45.190
I'm here, Saya.

01:36:45.820 --> 01:36:46.780
Fumito...

01:36:47.860 --> 01:36:50.740
I told you, it's hard for me...

01:36:51.610 --> 01:36:55.120
I tried it on myself right away.

01:36:56.200 --> 01:36:58.910
If I could be the same thing that you are...

01:37:04.250 --> 01:37:08.010
I could finally hold you.

01:37:09.720 --> 01:37:11.550
I am sorry, Saya.

01:37:11.550 --> 01:37:13.640
If I were human,

01:37:13.640 --> 01:37:18.310
your curse... would be broken.

01:37:20.930 --> 01:37:26.320
To the victor... to you... the spoils...

01:37:26.730 --> 01:37:29.900
And to me, the vanquished... damnation.

01:37:35.660 --> 01:37:39.450
You should have stayed away from me... Saya.

01:37:40.370 --> 01:37:42.620
It's no longer a punishment...

01:37:56.720 --> 01:37:58.760
In the end...

01:38:00.270 --> 01:38:02.060
...I'm...

01:38:04.350 --> 01:38:05.980
...alone...

01:38:20.660 --> 01:38:22.120
No can do.

01:38:22.120 --> 01:38:23.620
It's surrounded by police.

01:38:24.790 --> 01:38:28.090
The area is off-limits to everything except emergency vehicles.

01:38:28.960 --> 01:38:33.420
We can’t get in touch with Mogari-san at all.

01:38:34.130 --> 01:38:37.640
E-Excuse me, excuse me.

01:38:55.780 --> 01:39:01.240
Well, of course youths need their freedom, we need to nurture their minds.

01:39:01.700 --> 01:39:05.660
If you attempt to restrict their development so harshly, all they will give you is resistance.

01:39:05.660 --> 01:39:09.420
And most importantly, adults shouldn't lie to children.

01:39:10.500 --> 01:39:13.920
Tsuki-chan, did you like your classes?

01:39:13.920 --> 01:39:15.010
Yeah.

01:39:15.010 --> 01:39:16.760
I stayed until the end.

01:39:17.130 --> 01:39:19.090
Why don’t you join a club?

01:39:19.090 --> 01:39:21.050
Clubs are boring.

01:39:21.050 --> 01:39:23.720
It’s more fun playing with you guys.

01:39:25.100 --> 01:39:26.310
Mana!

01:39:27.520 --> 01:39:29.190
Hey!

01:39:30.110 --> 01:39:37.280
Once she became the governor, the internet restrictions were lifted.

01:39:37.280 --> 01:39:40.370
The Juvenile Protection Curfew Act was abolished as well.

01:39:40.370 --> 01:39:43.540
It's like heaven compared to how it was back then.

01:39:46.120 --> 01:39:50.130
Mogari-san... is gone, isn't he?

01:39:51.960 --> 01:39:58.970
Sysnet is no more, and all of Seventh Heaven's executives were replaced.

01:39:58.970 --> 01:40:05.850
Nanahara Fumito's existence has been completely erased, even from the internet.

01:40:06.680 --> 01:40:10.850
I'm sorry for bringing up such a depressing topic.

01:40:12.650 --> 01:40:19.110
Well, it has been almost a year and a half since that day.

01:40:20.740 --> 01:40:21.990
But hey...

01:40:21.990 --> 01:40:23.410
But?

01:40:23.410 --> 01:40:25.700
That's Matsuo-kun’s fault.

01:40:25.950 --> 01:40:27.500
No, it isn't!

01:40:27.500 --> 01:40:28.790
You aren't cute!

01:40:28.790 --> 01:40:30.540
Am too!

01:40:30.540 --> 01:40:32.670
They're fighting again...

01:40:32.670 --> 01:40:34.550
You're not being cute at all!

01:40:33.790 --> 01:40:36.670
Aren't they getting married next month?

01:40:34.550 --> 01:40:35.750
What do you mean?

01:40:35.750 --> 01:40:38.420
Because you're clueless about stuff like this.

01:40:36.670 --> 01:40:40.430
They're as adorable as ever, Matsu-san and Yanagi-san.

01:40:38.420 --> 01:40:39.220
What?

01:40:40.430 --> 01:40:44.300
Hey there, don’t fight.

01:40:44.300 --> 01:40:46.720
Well, of course, <i>you're</i> the cute one.

01:40:46.720 --> 01:40:49.430
What? What are you talking about, you jerk!?

01:40:50.600 --> 01:40:51.770
Who're are you calling cute?

01:40:51.770 --> 01:40:52.480
What?

01:40:52.480 --> 01:40:56.400
But you see, I believe I will get to meet her...

01:40:56.900 --> 01:40:58.280
...once again.
